@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Iniciar sesión como recepción (copia data.token en @token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "recepcion",
  "contrasena": "CitaSync2026"
}

###
@token = pega-aqui-el-token

### Listar citas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/citas?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear paciente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "persona": {
    "tipoDocumento": "DNI",
    "numeroDocumento": "40000004",
    "nombres": "Prueba",
    "apellidos": "HTTP Client"
  }
}

### Registrar llegada de la cita 1
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/citas/1/llegada
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial de estados de la cita 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/citas/1/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
